5d688a9","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"最初 `#` が必要なことに気づかず、7119 に掛けたら「この番号は現在使われておりません」と言われて焦った。\n4桁の電話番号ってどういう扱いになるのだろう。市内通話というわけでもないだろうし。","ts":"1627792100.064000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"34=Jc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0f74d4c-c73f-40dc-bbf5-1efccddfe8cf","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"日曜は普通はどこも外来はやってなくて、やってたとしても救急外来ですね。\nま、ちょうど2週間前に `#7119` して救急外来使いましたが…","ts":"1627791017.061800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8a0M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b9417d4-b5f2-4ca2-9ba0-01e4cdf59ce8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"タイミングというか、体調で出ることもありますしね","ts":"1627790426.059700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bWa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E22B4C71-9B5B-4203-BF4B-276ADC496911","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ツライ","ts":"1627790401.059300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OQB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D9C1E67A-075C-4F3F-B94D-2A562E1BEBE1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"病院空いてると思ってたら、そもそも掲載されてる情報が古くて今日病院やってなかった","ts":"1627790399.059200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VX7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ef1df57-87c3-47f5-8c87-dd16d1dff440","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"私も全身に赤いできものができたことあって検査したらアレルギーと言える数値が出たことはありますが、医者いわく気にしなくていいとのことだったので、気にせず食ってたら症状もでなくなりましたね(全身にできものができても大丈夫だったという例です\n軽いアレルギーのせいで知らず知らず体調を崩している人って結構いるらしいので、知ることは大事そう","ts":"1627790337.058200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mhna="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2bd55f6-4004-40f8-99f3-62c20acbceef","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"プロテインにはいってるというか、タンパク質系のアレルゲンいろいろあるから、内容物的に可能性はいつでもありそう","ts":"1627789201.054100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6j8RZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F1D2D187-B3AA-4A90-AE22-B4D6811CC9CF","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"初めてのことなのでちょっと戸惑ってる","ts":"1627788550.052700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":6,"users":["U81LLJ340","UL6CFN8NR","U022XK5866Q","UDPT2BZ6E","U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3MS9t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B6CF8A1F-3136-4541-A68E-A6B54D8E9BFE","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"今朝食べたのは\n半熟卵とソーセージくらいなので、多分どちらかと思われます","ts":"1627788533.052100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m=cb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abd5172e-d847-4afd-866b-b50a788f1b7e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"プロテインの中にはアレルギー起こす物質入った物もあるみたいすね。","ts":"1627788468.051200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sDw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37ce6c8b-7c04-4367-830e-f3cb36e09bd5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"アレルギー物質は、瞬間的な物じゃなく蓄積な事もあるので、突然症状が出て以降続く事もありますね。花粉症がいい例。","ts":"1627788293.050300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8s2kV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F8C41002-288C-4F60-9FC3-F5A22D8F13DD","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なんか食べたのか、それとも何か触ったのか…","ts":"1627788108.048600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BAc4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8483205C-E4BE-44B1-8307-E874A8FFBE2D","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1421671625896857600?s=21|https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1421671625896857600?s=21\u003e","ts":"1627788076.047800","attachm